# Ignore with from=

A copy of a compiled file counts as verified.

```flow ignore="weird_t is not a C type" from="src/kernel.flow"
function twice(x: weird_t) -> weird_t {
    return x
}
```

A copy that drifted from the file does not.

```flow ignore="weird_t is not a C type" from="src/kernel.flow"
function twice(x: weird_t) -> weird_t {
    return x + x
}
```

A plain ignore is still not compiler-checked in strict mode.

```flow ignore="placeholder"
function f() -> i32 { ... }
```
